# Smoke: an accepted decision with no architecture to the first accepted Reference Architecture.
id: architecture-smoke
skill: highway-architecture
fixture: adr-accepted
smoke: yes
open: /highway-architecture Use Scheduled Pipeline For Restock Alerts
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask-pattern: \?
say: [accept] Yes, go ahead.
writes: architectures/architectures.md
writes: architectures/*.md
writes: adrs/adrs.md
writes: adrs/*.md
expect: template architectures/architectures.md :: architecture-catalog.md
expect: template architectures/RA*.md :: architecture-record.md
